{"id":"f2143c499aae70cc","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-very-strong-equality.md","title":"内等式反映外等式","display":"df-very-strong-equality — 内等式反映外等式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-very-strong-equality","aliases":["16-df-very-strong-equality","Very strong equality"],"display":"df-very-strong-equality — 内等式反映外等式","depends_on":["[[16-df-internal-equality]]"],"source":"§3.4, p. 192 (PDF 212)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-very-strong-equality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-very-strong-equality</span><span>Very strong equality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-very-strong-equality — 内等式反映外等式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§3.4, p. 192 (PDF 212)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是 Eq-fibration，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_p\">\\(\\equiv_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}very\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\mathcal B)(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\\\n(u\\equiv_pv\\Rightarrow u=v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}very\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\mathcal B)(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\\\n(u\\equiv_pv\\Rightarrow u=v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是本书 §3.4 的用语：内部逻辑反映基范畴箭头的实际相等。</li>\n<li>不能用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}\\dashv\\delta^*\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}\\dashv\\delta^*\\)</span> 的单位可逆来替代它。依赖类型中的 strong equality 使用理解投影，另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec6ba39693a55895\" href=\"?note=ec6ba39693a55895\" title=\"16-df-strong-equality\">16-df-strong-equality</a>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§3.4, p. 192 (PDF 212)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是 Eq-fibration，$\\equiv_p$ 见 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"ec6ba39693a55895","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"不能用 $\\mathsf{Eq}\\dashv\\delta^*$ 的单位可逆来替代它。依赖类型中的 strong equality 使用理解投影，另见 [[16-df-strong-equality]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}very\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I,J\\in\\mathcal B)(\\forall u,v\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\\\n(u\\equiv_pv\\Rightarrow u=v).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}\\dashv\\delta^*","display":false}],"bytes":1266,"backlinks":[{"id":"cce22fc8a4f2f9e3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p$ 是 Eq-fibration；$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}$ 见 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]]，$\\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为旧拼写。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-381","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-very-strong-equality|df-very-strong-equality — 内等式反映外等式]]"},{"id":"d2e1d180cc0ebd2e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假设 $\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)$，采用 [[16-df-subset-type]]。$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}$ 是 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]] 中待刻画的谓词，未预先假设成立；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$e_I,\\delta_I$ 及 $\\kappa_I$ 如下定义，$\\pi_1,\\pi_2$ 为 $I\\times I$ 的所选投影。"},{"id":"775a56acaa867972","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da549ca22fc9a7df","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"内部等式 $\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)$、$\\equiv_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]；$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)$ 采用 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]]。"}],"outgoing":["93b3305f115fb8fd","ec6ba39693a55895"]}